<title>INDIA: Indian castor trade closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Indian castor trade closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's castor trade was closed on Wednesday for a Hindu festival, dealers said.</p>
<p>They said trading will resume on Thursday.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, castorseed December delivery prices fell to 1,129/1,130 rupees per quintal from 1,132/1,133 on fresh offerings, dealers said.</p>
<p>Reports of the commencement of the third and final round of rain in the producing centres triggered bull liquidation at higher levels, they said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Commodities +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
